<title>USA: Magellan Health says raises self-tender.</title>
<headline>Magellan Health says raises self-tender.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magellan Health Services Inc said on Thursday it increased the number of shares it is seeking in its Dutch Auction self-tender to 3.3 million shares from 1.892 million previously.</p>
<p>The price range within which the company will accept tenders remains at between $16.50 to $18.50 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>It said through September 4, about 224,000 shares had been tendered and not withdrawn, and the offer has been extended through September 18.</p>
</text>
